WEBVTT

1
00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.994
<i>My dad used to say...</i>

2
00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:42.459
<i>that I am too soft-hearted, because I succeeded in him.</i>

3
00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.085
I will leave it.

4
00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:46.838
No. Return to where you took it.

5
00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:48.506
No, I'll keep it to myself.

6
00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.925
Me and dad are busy. Who will take care of him?

7
00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.678
I'll take care of him myself!

8
00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.263
And how will you do it?

9
00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:56.890
No one will help you.

10
00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:59.517
Well, mom. Please!

11
00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:00.435
No.

12
00:01:00.518 --> 00:01:02.187
Be sweet, mother!

13
00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:05.940
{\an8}- Take him away!
<i>- And that I get attached too easily.</i>

14
00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:09.819
wait

15
00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:12.238
You…

16
00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.618
are you going home like that again?

17
00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:21.790
That's not good. jump in

18
00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:29.005
From now on tell everyone that you are my brother.

19
00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:34.552
Where are the kids who make fun of you?

20
00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:37.680
hold on

21
00:01:39.849 --> 00:01:43.144
<i>Especially to small unfortunate creatures.</i>

22
00:01:43.728 --> 00:01:44.729
<i>But, you know,</i>

23
00:01:45.313 --> 00:01:47.732
they disappear quickly

24
00:01:47.816 --> 00:01:50.110
you might be in pain

25
00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.403
I'm all for my mother.

26
00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:54.447
And that's true.

27
00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:58.368
You are brave like mother

28
00:01:58.451 --> 00:01:59.994
you can handle everything

29
00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.623
And already such an adult.

30
00:02:04.249 --> 00:02:07.085
I need to buy you a bigger bike.

31
00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:09.087
Maybe red?

32
00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:12.674
Eat ice cream.

33
00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:17.053
<i>Apparently, dad already knew what would happen.</i>

34
00:02:17.887 --> 00:02:19.722
CON

35
00:02:37.532 --> 00:02:40.493
FOR SALE

36
00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:58.720
<i>Hello,</i>

37
00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:02.599
girl pretending to be evil
but actually very good.

38
00:03:05.727 --> 00:03:08.563
- I practiced the line.
- This is not your reply.

39
00:03:08.646 --> 00:03:10.815
Did you learn my lines again?

40
00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:12.984
But you are obsessed with me.

41
00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:18.156
<i>But he is not small...</i>

42
00:03:18.239 --> 00:03:22.660
<i>Come on, horse</i>

43
00:03:22.744 --> 00:03:27.081
<i>Come on, horse</i>

44
00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:28.208
<i>Haida...</i>

45
00:03:28.291 --> 00:03:29.876
<i>…and not unhappy at all.</i>

46
00:03:32.128 --> 00:03:34.714
<i>- </i>Happy journey!
- Be careful!

47
00:03:34.797 --> 00:03:37.634
- Good job, sir!
- Welcome, director Ma!

48
00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.385
- Good night!
- See you soon!

49
00:03:39.469 --> 00:03:40.970
Go ahead!

50
00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:42.472
Next round!

51
00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:43.890
- Let's go!
- Next round!

52
00:03:43.973 --> 00:03:45.892
- All well done. Come on!
- Well done!

53
00:03:45.975 --> 00:03:47.477
Third round!

54
00:03:52.649 --> 00:03:55.318
<i>He is simply the strangest person of all.</i>

55
00:03:56.694 --> 00:03:58.279
wait

56
00:03:58.363 --> 00:04:01.491
You see, I drank too much today.

57
00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:03.826
Then go home.

58
00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.787
- No, wait.
- What are you...

59
00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:12.418
Will you be my "sober driver"?

60
00:04:19.217 --> 00:04:22.470
Leave the bike, pick it up tomorrow.

61
00:04:22.553 --> 00:04:25.640
Not too smart
in the country of bicycle thieves.

62
00:04:26.224 --> 00:04:28.017
It looks inexpensive.

63
00:04:29.519 --> 00:04:31.354
My brother gave it to me.

64
00:04:47.537 --> 00:04:52.125
What about a "sober driver"
don't have to pick up customers?

65
00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:54.794
You'd better be quiet, or I'll drop everything and leave.

66
00:04:58.214 --> 00:05:00.675
Red is a "flashy" color.

67
00:05:04.178 --> 00:05:05.471
The thing is

68
00:05:06.306 --> 00:05:08.808
that my brother said red is the best…

69
00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:15.565
Are you close with your brother?

70
00:05:16.858 --> 00:05:17.859
Tell about him?

71
00:05:18.901 --> 00:05:24.324
My brother is tall and handsome.

72
00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:27.577
He was very popular at school.

73
00:05:28.786 --> 00:05:32.540
- The girls gave him candy...
<i>- I will never get attached to him.</i>

74
00:05:35.543 --> 00:05:37.045
<i>It is impossible.</i>

75
00:05:40.882 --> 00:05:42.800
wait Let's look again.

76
00:05:42.884 --> 00:05:45.303
<i>Maybe dad's prophecy, a curse or something...</i>

77
00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.848
<i>- </i>Song Thae.
- What?

78
00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:51.184
Still no contact with Gyom?

79
00:05:51.267 --> 00:05:52.352
No

80
00:05:52.977 --> 00:05:54.812
He wanted to see the installation...

81
00:05:54.896 --> 00:05:57.982
<i>…was the reason,</i>
<i>why I was left alone again.</i>

82
00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:16.709
KO GYOM

83
00:06:25.134 --> 00:06:26.552
<i>At first I was worried.</i>

84
00:06:27.136 --> 00:06:29.639
You have a day off. Why don't you rest?

85
00:06:33.768 --> 00:06:35.019
<i>Then she was angry.</i>

86
00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.481
<i>And in the end...</i>

87
00:06:38.981 --> 00:06:40.066
Is everything so bad?

88
00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:41.401
What?

89
00:06:41.484 --> 00:06:42.985
I'm talking about you.

90
00:06:45.113 --> 00:06:46.697
No, ma'am.

91
00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:56.666
You are not quiet by nature.

92
00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.586
But I see that something is bothering you.

93
00:07:01.254 --> 00:07:04.257
Sorry. I thought about it.

94
00:07:06.884 --> 00:07:07.718
you know

95
00:07:08.636 --> 00:07:11.681
when you make a movie like we are now

96
00:07:11.764 --> 00:07:13.933
you can't just forget.

97
00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.813
You have the opportunity to collect
all those thoughts that distract you

98
00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.982
and burn them to the ground.

99
00:07:24.986 --> 00:07:25.862
work

100
00:07:26.654 --> 00:07:31.033
Work hard and make your film.

101
00:07:32.452 --> 00:07:36.456
And what happens there

102
00:07:36.539 --> 00:07:39.750
use as kindling for a fire.

103
00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:43.963
Madam, we are ready. Want to take a look?

104
00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:47.216
Of course. Come on.

105
00:07:50.344 --> 00:07:52.930
<i>I understood what should be done.</i>

106
00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:58.519
<i>That day I decided to work</i>
<i>and forget about him...</i>

107
00:07:58.603 --> 00:07:59.437
Kim Mubi!

108
00:08:00.271 --> 00:08:01.105
What?

109
00:08:01.772 --> 00:08:06.027
<i>…and to think that he died like everyone else.</i>

110
00:08:10.072 --> 00:08:14.494
Fortunately, the pressure
and vital signs stabilized.

111
00:08:14.577 --> 00:08:18.080
But the brain suffered significant damage
due to cardiac arrest

112
00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:21.709
so it may take a long time
before he regains consciousness.

113
00:08:21.792 --> 00:08:24.962
<i>Everyone said that he miraculously survived.</i>

114
00:08:25.463 --> 00:08:29.008
Not everything is clear because of the lack of cameras.

115
00:08:30.384 --> 00:08:32.929
<i>But the video recorder</i>
<i>did not detect cars nearby.</i>

116
00:08:38.559 --> 00:08:43.147
We classify the accident as an accident
due to morning fog and rain.

117
00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:47.109
<i>They say he was lucky</i>
<i>because it could have been worse.</i>

118
00:08:47.193 --> 00:08:49.779
<i>And what else did they say there?</i>

119
00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:52.198
If there is no improvement in two weeks,

120
00:08:52.281 --> 00:08:54.283
prepare for the worst.

121
00:08:55.576 --> 00:08:57.411
"Prepare for the worst."

122
00:08:59.705 --> 00:09:01.249
They say that not only in the movies?

123
00:09:31.737 --> 00:09:32.989
Why are you here again?

124
00:09:33.489 --> 00:09:34.907
So that Chun could rest a little.

125
00:09:34.991 --> 00:09:37.910
It annoys him that you don't leave him.

126
00:09:38.995 --> 00:09:42.415
<i>It turned out that all these words are a complete delusion.</i>

127
00:09:42.498 --> 00:09:44.834
If this is true, I myself will be fired.

128
00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:48.671
<i>Because my brother would never</i>
<i>didn't let me survive</i>

129
00:09:48.754 --> 00:09:50.423
<i>"prepare for the worst".</i>

130
00:09:51.048 --> 00:09:52.008
ok

131
00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:55.469
<i>Recover to live</i>
<i>ful life? I don't know

132
00:09:55.553 --> 00:09:56.387
That's it.

133
00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:58.973
<i>It will take at least half a year,</i>
<i>maybe several years.</i>

134
00:10:04.645 --> 00:10:06.147
Lower your lower lip.

135
00:10:06.647 --> 00:10:10.484
<i>Problems with communication indicate,</i>
<i>that full recovery is unlikely.</i>

136
00:10:11.068 --> 00:10:14.405
Shall we go eat some pork chops?

137
00:10:16.657 --> 00:10:19.493
listen

138
00:10:20.244 --> 00:10:21.329
You…

139
00:10:23.372 --> 00:10:24.790
did you eat something

140
00:10:27.168 --> 00:10:28.419
Let's go...

141
00:10:31.922 --> 00:10:33.966
overeat…

142
00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.762
pork chops?

143
00:10:39.055 --> 00:10:40.181
Class!

144
00:10:42.141 --> 00:10:45.770
{\an8}<i>For rehabilitation</i>
<i>the most important thing is the willpower of the patient.</i>

145
00:10:46.354 --> 00:10:49.357
<i>I don't know,</i>
<i>how long will rehabilitation take.</i>

146
00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.775
Do you want to rest?

147
00:10:56.072 --> 00:10:58.240
There is also linen here. Change regularly.

148
00:10:58.324 --> 00:10:59.158
sir

149
00:11:00.326 --> 00:11:01.535
As for the rent…

150
00:11:01.619 --> 00:11:03.537
are you kidding

151
00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.332
Everything is fine. don't worry

152
00:11:09.502 --> 00:11:11.003
I will pay later.

153
00:11:14.006 --> 00:11:17.343
And you? how are you doing Do you mind?

154
00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.181
It's not difficult at all.

155
00:11:23.724 --> 00:11:25.726
I was born to be a guardian.

156
00:11:29.188 --> 00:11:30.940
He is there alone.

157
00:11:31.023 --> 00:11:32.775
- I'll go already.
- Of course.

158
00:11:33.693 --> 00:11:35.027
