- Yes.

159
00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:37.405
Call if you need anything.

160
00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:38.864
Necessarily.

161
00:11:46.372 --> 00:11:47.373
Hello.

162
00:11:47.456 --> 00:11:50.292
<i>Greetings, this is Kang Chi Yoon from the 25th Frame magazine.</i>

163
00:11:50.376 --> 00:11:52.878
<i>I sent you an email.</i>

164
00:11:52.962 --> 00:11:55.131
<i>Are you comfortable talking now?</i>

165
00:11:55.965 --> 00:11:57.717
