170
00:12:36.046 --> 00:12:38.674
ESSENTIAL REVIEWS OF MR. GODAM

171
00:12:38.758 --> 00:12:41.552
{\an8}2009, "AIMLESS BALL"

172
00:12:47.767 --> 00:12:50.436
WHY DON'T YOU WRITE?
I AM WAITING FOR YOUR REVIEW

173
00:12:50.519 --> 00:12:52.521
ARE YOU OK? I READ YOUR BLOG

174
00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:11.248
{\an8}TODAY'S CINEMA

175
00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.806
<i>Not difficult at all.</i>

176
00:13:35.606 --> 00:13:37.858
Boss, congratulations on the discharge.

177
00:13:37.942 --> 00:13:39.151
Again you stand up for yourself.

178
00:13:41.821 --> 00:13:44.907
