EPISODE 2
WHY SO SERIOUS?

213
00:16:42.543 --> 00:16:43.460
Are you here yet?

214
00:16:43.544 --> 00:16:44.962
why did you come

215
00:16:45.045 --> 00:16:46.880
Be grateful that at least I'm with you.

216
00:16:46.964 --> 00:16:48.966
I have to go again. What is it?

217
00:16:53.012 --> 00:16:55.014
Did something happen? Where is Chun?

218
00:16:55.848 --> 00:16:57.099
In the rehabilitation center.

219
00:16:57.641 --> 00:16:59.226
Himself? This is progress.

220
00:17:02.229 --> 00:17:03.063
what's wrong with you

221
00:17:04.732 --> 00:17:05.566
Nothing.

222
00:17:08.444 --> 00:17:09.695
have you been to the cinema

223
00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:12.698
I'm running Turn off the lights when you leave.

224
00:17:20.289 --> 00:17:22.958
"WHY SO SERIOUS?"

225
00:17:24.043 --> 00:17:26.962
<i>I just wanted to look.</i>

226
00:17:49.485 --> 00:17:52.404
<i>See what movie she made.</i>

227
00:17:52.488 --> 00:17:55.074
<i>- A lot happened last year.</i>
<i>- I was interested.</i>

228
00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:58.869
