242
00:19:36.842 --> 00:19:37.926
Yes.

243
00:19:40.429 --> 00:19:44.016
I asked about the reasons. "Yes" does not have...

244
00:19:44.099 --> 00:19:46.226
Yes, I had my reasons.

245
00:19:49.188 --> 00:19:53.692
I'm afraid our time is up
let's move on to the next part.

246
00:19:53.775 --> 00:19:57.779
Let's listen to the actors and the director herself.

247
00:19:57.863 --> 00:20:00.741
Hello, I'm Wu Chu,
and I play one of the main roles.

248
00:20:01.325 --> 00:20:03.577
- Hello, I'm a big fan!
- Hello!

249
00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:05.329
- I'm a fan.
- Great job.

250
00:20:05.871 --> 00:20:06.788
Shall we drink later?

251
00:20:30.187 --> 00:20:31.021
Han Sol.

252
00:20:31.104 --> 00:20:32.105
What?

253
00:20:32.189 --> 00:20:36.443
Where can you watch?
record of today's meeting?

254
00:20:36.526 --> 00:20:39.112
I will send the link.

255
00:20:39.988 --> 00:20:40.822
Good.

