00:42:13.989 --> 00:42:16.909
RETROSPECTIVE OF THE DIRECTOR CHOO HEE-YEON

531
00:42:16.992 --> 00:42:20.579
NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS, DON'T STOP

532
00:42:28.170 --> 00:42:30.923
CHOO HEE YONG
RETROSPECTIVE

533
00:42:38.264 --> 00:42:39.848
Congratulations!

534
00:42:47.022 --> 00:42:49.024
Are you working on your next film?

535
00:42:49.108 --> 00:42:52.861
I never stop
to prepare for new films.

536
00:42:52.945 --> 00:42:55.447
But we'll see.

537
00:42:56.365 --> 00:43:00.286
Are there actors
which ones would you like to work with?

538
00:43:00.369 --> 00:43:02.204
No one in particular.

539
00:43:02.288 --> 00:43:06.709
I need to see the finished script
to think about it.

540
00:43:07.418 --> 00:43:10.087
Korea has so much talent…

541
00:43:16.385 --> 00:43:18.220
<i>I know I'm talking nonsense.</i>

542
00:43:21.307 --> 00:43:22.975
<i>But that day</i>

543
00:43:23.892 --> 00:43:28.355
<i>Ko Gyom resembled a human,</i>
<i>who was returning home from a trip.</i>

544
00:44:02.931 --> 00:44:07.561
<i>He seemed relieved</i>
<i>and somehow felt exhausted.</i>

545
00:44:35.130 --> 00:44:37.675
Director Kim, there you are.
And I called you.

546
00:44:38.467 --> 00:44:40.636
That's even better. I will say personally.

547
00:44:40.719 --> 00:44:44.306
- About what you asked me to do.
- What are you talking about?

548
00:44:44.390 --> 00:44:47.309
when we drank recently
you asked to find someone.

549
00:44:48.102 --> 00:44:50.270
You are about...

550
00:44:50.354 --> 00:44:53.357
that boy
who asked you a rude question.

551
00:44:54.108 --> 00:44:55.943
Oh no. Everything is fine.

552
00:44:56.026 --> 00:44:58.070
You said he was a fraud.

553
00:44:58.153 --> 00:45:01.865
I watched the video many times,
to find out where he sat.

554
00:45:01.949 --> 00:45:05.202
It turns out that he was invited.

555
00:45:05.285 --> 00:45:06.787
Godi about it. Everything is fine.

556
00:45:06.870 --> 00:45:08.956
No. You know what's interesting?

557
00:45:09.039 --> 00:45:10.207
He…

558
00:45:10.290 --> 00:45:12.501
Gomm! what are you doing there come here

559
00:45:13.043 --> 00:45:15.170
He is a film critic... What?

560
00:45:15.254 --> 00:45:18.090
- This is the scoundrel! It's him!
- No.

561
00:45:18.173 --> 00:45:19.925
- No, not him.
- He!

562
00:45:20.008 --> 00:45:22.886
- He doesn't look like him.
- Wait. It's him.

563
00:45:22.970 --> 00:45:24.304
You are wrong.

564
00:45:27.224 --> 00:45:28.726
- I'm telling you.
- No.

565
00:45:28.809 --> 00:45:30.644
- It's not him.
- But...

566
00:45:31.145 --> 00:45:32.646
- No.
- Now I understand.

567
00:45:33.230 --> 00:45:36.191
Did he write a bad review?

568
00:45:36.275 --> 00:45:37.860
No, not that.

569
00:45:37.943 --> 00:45:40.154
I can't believe it. They are such critics.

570
00:45:40.237 --> 00:45:42.990
They see only something bad.

571
00:45:43.073 --> 00:45:44.867
Yes, probably.

572
00:45:44.950 --> 00:45:48.287
Director Kim.
Directors and critics are enemies.

573
00:45:48.912 --> 00:45:50.414
Come on. It begins.

574
00:45:50.497 --> 00:45:51.665
Let's hurry!

575
00:45:51.749 --> 00:45:53.625
We are late!

576
00:46:05.679 --> 00:46:06.513
Director Kim.

577
00:46:07.264 --> 00:46:09.183
Congratulations on your debut.

578
00:46:47.554 --> 00:46:48.388
I'm listening

579
00:46:48.472 --> 00:46:50.891
<i>Where are you? Everyone communicates here.</i>

580
00:46:50.974 --> 00:46:51.809
<i>There will be a party!</i>

581
00:46:52.559 --> 00:46:54.895
Something happened, I had to go.

582
00:46:54.978 --> 00:46:56.480
I am very sorry. bye

583
00:47:27.261 --> 00:47:29.513
It can't be.

584
00:47:35.561 --> 00:47:36.395
Oh god!

585
00:47:39.565 --> 00:47:43.026
How did you disappear so quickly?

586
00:47:43.527 --> 00:47:44.611
have you been following me

587
00:47:44.695 --> 00:47:48.323
You dropped your keys and ran.
I thought you wanted me to follow you.

588
00:47:52.202 --> 00:47:53.036
Give it back

589
00:48:00.252 --> 00:48:01.461
What are you…

590
00:48:04.256 --> 00:48:06.425
Will you be my "sober driver"?

591
00:48:16.310 --> 00:48:18.478
Since when are you a film critic?

592
00:48:19.062 --> 00:48:21.940
Since when do I get paid for reviews.

593
00:48:22.024 --> 00:48:23.525
And he wrote reviews of my films?

594
00:48:24.026 --> 00:48:25.319
- Not yet.
- Are you planning?

595
00:48:26.111 --> 00:48:27.029
I haven't decided yet.

596
00:48:27.112 --> 00:48:28.572
Why did you come then?

597
00:48:28.655 --> 00:48:31.241
- I was interested.
- What exactly?

598
00:48:31.325 --> 00:48:33.744
I wanted to see what movie you made.

599
00:48:34.244 --> 00:48:36.747
You were also looking for information about me.

600
00:48:36.830 --> 00:48:38.332
I? No.

601
00:48:39.207 --> 00:48:40.751
She called me a fraud.

602
00:48:40.834 --> 00:48:41.752
obviously

603
00:48:43.170 --> 00:48:46.006
directors and critics are enemies.

604
00:49:16.119 --> 00:49:18.455
You have changed a lot.

605
00:49:21.249 --> 00:49:24.962
Even then I suspected
that you are not one of the quiet ones.

606
00:49:34.763 --> 00:49:35.764
were you sick

607
00:49:38.809 --> 00:49:39.643
No.

608
00:49:40.227 --> 00:49:42.813
Did someone die?

609
00:49:44.982 --> 00:49:45.816
No.

610
00:49:45.899 --> 00:49:48.402
Did you commit a crime and go to jail?

611
00:49:49.903 --> 00:49:51.571
- Not either.
- Then what?

612
00:50:06.837 --> 00:50:08.714
You decided that I was easily accessible.

613
00:50:13.218 --> 00:50:15.137
Do not dream before my eyes anymore.

614
00:51:26.083 --> 00:51:27.417
Mom

615
00:51:27.918 --> 00:51:29.002
Greetings.

616
00:51:31.254 --> 00:51:33.673
Looks like they are doing repairs there.
The house has been idle for so long.

617
00:51:35.425 --> 00:51:38.512
I heard that the territory is being leveled
for a person in a wheelchair.

618
00:51:38.595 --> 00:51:39.930
Truth?

619
00:51:50.941 --> 00:51:52.025
Sorry.

620
00:51:57.405 --> 00:51:59.116
I live opposite.

621
00:52:01.243 --> 00:52:02.077
Excuse me!

622
00:52:06.373 --> 00:52:08.583
what are you doing here

623
00:52:09.167 --> 00:52:12.629
I am renovating my house. What are you doing here?

624
00:52:13.463 --> 00:52:14.631
are you my neighbor

625
00:52:20.220 --> 00:52:21.138
are you my neighbor

626
00:52:21.221 --> 00:52:22.556
are you crazy

627
00:52:23.140 --> 00:52:24.474
What? A minute

628
00:52:24.558 --> 00:52:27.602
you say it like that
as if I followed you all the way here.

629
00:52:27.686 --> 00:52:30.522
What then? Are you saying it's just a coincidence?

630
00:52:34.234 --> 00:52:36.987
Goem, do you want chajangmyeon for lunch?

631
00:52:37.070 --> 00:52:38.697
Chun, wait.

632
00:52:39.531 --> 00:52:43.535
My brother chose this house.
I don't like what you're implying.

633
00:52:45.871 --> 00:52:48.081
But how...

634
00:52:48.165 --> 00:52:50.041
You don't do anything.

635
00:52:51.126 --> 00:52:53.461
Keep your enemies closer, right?

636
00:52:53.545 --> 00:52:54.588
What?

637
00:52:54.671 --> 00:52:56.381
You said we were enemies.

638
00:53:02.888 --> 00:53:06.224
Let's try to act like enemies.

639
00:53:26.870 --> 00:53:32.125
LIKE IN THE MOVIE

640
00:53:33.335 --> 00:53:35.378
{\an8}Check and sign.

641
00:53:35.462 --> 00:53:36.838
{\an8}3 YEARS AGO

642
00:53:36.922 --> 00:53:39.049
{\an8}Your insurance does not cover the caregiver.

643
00:53:39.132 --> 00:53:42.552
Nothing. We don't need him.
I will take care of him myself.

644
00:53:42.636 --> 00:53:43.637
Truth?

645
00:53:44.137 --> 00:53:45.138
For a moment.

646
00:53:55.357 --> 00:53:56.233
Eat the corn.

647
00:54:01.863 --> 00:54:03.114
I don't want

648
00:54:05.617 --> 00:54:07.661
What's wrong with her? She likes corn.

649
00:54:17.128 --> 00:54:18.463
I have to go out!

650
00:55:05.552 --> 00:55:07.721
HAVON SOGAN HOSPITAL

651
00:55:08.596 --> 00:55:09.431
hello

652
00:55:09.931 --> 00:55:12.517
<i>- Are you a relative of Mr. Ko Chun?</i>
- Yes.

653
00:55:12.600 --> 00:55:15.437
<i>This is from the hospital. Come as soon as possible.</i>

654
00:55:32.954 --> 00:55:34.372
KO GYOM

